This project embeds the Hershey Script font data (internal/font/hershey-script.jhf),
included verbatim and unmodified. It is not covered by the MIT license above.

    The Hershey Fonts were originally created by Dr. A. V. Hershey while working
    at the U. S. National Bureau of Standards.

    The format of the Font data in this distribution was originally created by
        James Hurt
        Cognition, Inc.
        900 Technology Park Drive
        Billerica, MA 01821
        (mit-eddie!ci-dandelion!hurt)

The full font license text is in internal/font/HERSHEY-LICENSE.txt.
